            "review_title": "Review at Capone's Chicago Deep Dish & Street Food",
            "review_text": "Mark\nPhan Rang-Thap Cham, Vietnam6 contributions\n0\nI really wanted to like it\nNov 2020\nIt is the best Chicago style deep dish pizza in Saigon. Unfortunately the operations does not match the pizza. We asked for a North Side Pie but was informed there was no sausage so our pie would get a discount. We said yes although disappointed since why order a deep dish with no sausage. However when the bill came, no discount and the owner made my wife feel cheap beacause she asked where the discount was. Hopefully they will figure out the operations before they go out of business like so many SIgon restaurants before them.\nRead more\nValue\nService\nFood\nReview collected in partnership with this restaurant \nWritten November 20, 2020",
