            "review_title": "Review at Capone's Chicago Deep Dish & Street Food",
            "review_text": "Traveler O\nWashington DC, District of Columbia1256 contributions\n0\nExcellent Chicago Style pizza - Best in Vietnam\nMay 2020\nSuperb pizza by the river on the recently opened Road 13 (13 Duonf) in District 2. They have an excellent beer menu and the deep dish pizza outstanding. Arguably the best pizza in Vietnam. The manager/owner, Mark, a true foodie and a beer expert. The location is very convenient and it's nice to be by the river at night when the daily hustle and bustle ends. It's not to be missed. Great times all around with great food and beer along with friendly service. Absolutely recommend. \n\nNote: it's a new restaurant but they can and do also have delivery available-which was obvious with the number of pizzas being picked up by delivery drivers for customers. Worth it.\nRead more\nValue\nService\nFood\nReview collected in partnership with this restaurant \nWritten May 20, 2020",
