            "review_title": "Review at Capone's Chicago Deep Dish & Street Food",
            "review_text": "Scott\n1 contribution\n0\nCapone's Deep Dish Pizza Serves Up Great Pizza and Craft Beers on Tap\nApr 2020\nI've been a couple times and have had delivery about 5-6 times. The large deep dish pizza is a heck of a deal as you get a lot of pizza for the money. Loaded with toppings and cheese and the crust is a true Chicago style, flaky, pastry like crust. The pizza sauce is fantastic too. They've got a bar with seating toward the back with a bunch of local craft beers on tap. Ownership is western owned and one of the owners is from Chicago. It's a new restaurant and I'm actually adding it to trip advisor. Give them some support and have a pizza delivered. As it's \"covid\" time right now, no dine in guests are able to be served. I highly recommend it.\nRead more\nValue\nService\nFood\nReview collected in partnership with this restaurant \nWritten April 21, 2020",
